                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ok - I would recommend this game, for the price, it's a happy distraction. It doesn't really capture the magic of sensible soccer or kick-off though. It just doesn't. It's... still too basic. It's fun, it's playable, but it's just a little bit too shallow. What Sensible Soccer had (particularly) was the easy to play, difficult to master quality.  This game is too limited for that, but it's a really good effort.",
